enge, raising nearly $3 million, and the race has become one of the most expensive House contests on record.\n\nTwo recent polls, both from Democratic-leaning firms, show Hudson ahead by only four points, and prediction markets give Ojeda roughly a one-in-three chance. The Democratic Congressional Campaign Committee has gone on air attacking Hudson as corrupt, and Republicans appear uneasy. Still, the district's lean, Hudson's cash advantage, and Ojeda's thin war chest make the incumbent the clear favorite heading into Election Day.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.0964, "margin": -7.77}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.1187, "margin": -8.0}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.1157, "margin": -8.0}, {"date": "2026-09-25", "p_dem": 0.1153, "margin": -8.5}, {"date": "2026-09-26", "p_dem": 0.0919, "margin": -8.5}, {"date": "2026-09-27", "p_dem": 0.09, "margin": -8.0}, {"date": "2026-09-28", "p_dem": 0.1101, "margin": -8.0}, {"date": "2026-09-29", "p_dem": 0.1255, "margin": -8.0}, {"date": "2026-09-30", "p_dem": 0.1701, "margin": -6.5}, {"date": "2026-10-01", "p_dem": 0.1283, "margin": -8.0}, {"date": "2026-10-02", "p_dem": 0.1244, "margin": -8.0}, {"date": "2026-10-03", "p_dem": 0.1166, "margin": -8.0}, {"date": "2026-10-04", "p_dem": 0.1479, "margin": -7.0}, {"date": "2026-10-05", "p_dem": 0.13, "margin": -7.0}, {"date": "2026-10-06", "p_dem": 0.1287, "margin": -6.8}, {"date": "2026-10-07", "p_dem": 0.1426, "margin": -6.5}, {"date": "2026-10-08", "p_dem": 0.1099, "margin": -8.0}, {"date": "2026-10-09", "p_dem": 0.0748, "margin": -8.5}, {"date": "2026-10-10", "p_dem": 0.0789, "margin": -8.5}, {"date": "2026-10-11", "p_dem": 0.1002, "margin": -8.0}, {"date": "2026-10-12", "p_dem": 0.1391, "margin": -7.5}, {"date": "2026-10-13", "p_dem": 0.156, "margin": -6.5}, {"date": "2026-10-14", "p_dem": 0.1575, "margin": -6.5}, {"date": "2026-10-15", "p_dem": 0.0876, "margin": -8.0}, {"date": "2026-10-16", "p_dem": 0.11, "margin": -7.5}, {"date": "2026-10-17", "p_de